# A corridor: two parallel walls with a door in each, and a tie line square across the gap.
wall nwall from 0,1500 to 9000,1500 thick 150
wall swall from 0,0 to 9000,0 thick 150
parallel nwall.axis swall.axis
horizontal swall.axis
construction line gap from 100,0 to 100,1500
on gap.start swall.axis
on gap.end nwall.axis
perpendicular gap swall.axis
door d1 900 in swall.left
door d2 900 in nwall.right
